      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate and dedicated veterinary team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet guardians consistently praise Dr. Markus Luckwaldt alongside veterinary technicians Tara and Jem for their empathy, patience, and clear explanations. Reviewers appreciate that doctors avoid pushing unnecessary tests and respect client budgets, though one reviewer voiced distress after an urgent reptile case was declined."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 16,
      "title": {
        "en": "Experienced care for exotic companions"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight the hospital's exceptional skill with exotic species, including rabbits, fancy rats, geckos, canaries, and tortoises in addition to dogs and cats. Owners of skittish or nervous animals appreciate the gentle, low-stress handling and tailored husbandry advice provided during examinations."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 4,
      "title": {
        "en": "Accurate diagnoses and effective treatments"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers report successful clinical outcomes for serious conditions like gastrointestinal stasis in rabbits and reliable ongoing management of chronic feline ailments. Clients express lasting trust in the clinic's diagnostic accuracy, highlighting realistic treatment plans that effectively restore pet health and comfort."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
